        "date": "2026-11-17T17:29:37Z"
      },
      "message": "release: include nested Python site packages\n\nPrefix Python installs place site-packages beneath the standard library.\nThe stdlib copy excludes that directory, but the third-party selector also\nexcluded all stdlib descendants, omitting required packages such as\ncryptography from the staged runtime.\n\nKeep direct site-packages and dist-packages descendants in third-party\nselection while preserving the stdlib and dynamic-extension exclusions.\nAdd a focused regression for both nested layouts alongside the existing\nDebian sibling-layout coverage.\n\nBuilds on JPP's Linux bundler and tests and Numair's release integration.",
